---
---

<section class="section section-lg">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head-c">
      <span class="eyebrow">What we offer</span>
      <h2>Cybersecurity education for curious learners and proactive teams.</h2>
      <p>Whether you are learning cybersecurity for the first time or searching for a way to build safer software, QueryLock teaches security in a way that is clear, practical, and built around true understanding.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="offerings-grid">
      <a href="/learning" class="offering-card">
        <div class="offering-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 17H20"/>
            <path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 014 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 2z"/>
            <path d="M8 7h8M8 11h6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Guides Everyone Can Understand</h3>
        <p class="desc">Short, practical guides that help you understand technology and cybersecurity without needing a technical background first. In about 15 minutes, you can go from hearing a term to understanding how it works, why it matters, and what security risks come with it.</p>
        <ul class="offering-features">
          <li class="offering-feature">Explore the cloud, AI, databases, containers, web applications, firewalls, and more</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">Learn how the technology works and where security risks appear</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">Build conversational confidence in about 15 minutes</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">No coding or cybersecurity background needed</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">Read one focused guide instead of piecing together hours of content</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="offering-foot">
          <span class="offering-link">Explore the Guides <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/training" class="offering-card alt">
        <div class="offering-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H7a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/>
            <circle cx="10" cy="7" r="4"/>
            <path d="M21 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Tailored Training for Lasting Security</h3>
        <p class="desc">Hands-on security training built around your team&rsquo;s real environment. We tailor workshops to your stack, architecture, experience level, and goals so security becomes part of how your team builds, reviews, and ships software.</p>
        <ul class="offering-features">
          <li class="offering-feature">Secure coding training based on your technology and specific risks</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">Optional secure code review and secure development lifecycle topics</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">Findings-based workshops after a pentest or code review</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">AI and LLM security training for modern product teams</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">Practical improvements your team can apply after the workshop</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="offering-foot">
          <span class="offering-link">Schedule Training <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .offerings-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
  @media (min-width: 880px) { .offerings-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }

  .offering-card {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--ql-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    transition: transform .22s var(--ease-out), box-shadow .22s var(--ease-out), border-color .22s var(--ease-out);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .offering-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 24px 56px color-mix(in srgb, var(--ql-deep-purple) 14%, transparent); border-color: var(--ql-lavender-400); }
  @media (min-width: 760px) { .offering-card { padding: 40px; } }

  .offering-icon { width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--ql-deep-purple) 0%, var(--ql-violet) 100%); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--ql-white); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px color-mix(in srgb, var(--ql-violet) 28%, transparent); }
  .offering-card.alt .offering-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--ql-violet) 0%, var(--ql-magenta) 100%); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px color-mix(in srgb, var(--ql-magenta) 28%, transparent); }

  .offering-card h3 { font-weight: 800; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.015em; line-height: 1.12; margin: 0; }
  .offering-card .desc { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--fg-2); margin: 0; }

  .offering-features { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 8px 0 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .offering-feature { font-size: 15px; color: var(--fg-2); padding-left: 26px; position: relative; line-height: 1.5; }
  .offering-feature::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 6px;
    width: 16px; height: 16px;
    background: var(--ql-magenta);
    -webkit-mask: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><path d='M5 12l4 4 10-10' stroke='black' stroke-width='3' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/></svg>") center/contain no-repeat;
    mask: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><path d='M5 12l4 4 10-10' stroke='black' stroke-width='3' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/></svg>") center/contain no-repeat;
  }

  .offering-foot { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--ql-ink-100); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; }
  .offering-link { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ql-violet); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .offering-link .arrow { transition: transform .22s var(--ease-out); display: inline-block; }
  .offering-card:hover .offering-link .arrow { transform: translateX(4px); }
</style>
